{"title":"The Monstrous Manor","slug":"The_Monstrous_Manor","pageid":3328,"revid":21042,"timestamp":"2026-01-26T15:16:21Z","lastEditor":"Dutch265","categories":["Stubs","Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Purpose","value":"Sells Halloween Goods"},{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.68.0"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Headless Horseman"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>The Manor</b> is a new shop located near the <b>Taiga</b> and the <b>bridge to the Desert</b>. The shop is a part of the <b>2024 and</b> <b>2025 Halloween Event</b> and uses both Cash and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>, similar to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ghoulish_Goods/\">Ghoulish Goods</a> shop.\n</p><p>At the top of The Manor is an Altar that you can use to craft the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Crater_Chisel/\">Crater Chisel</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Astral_Saw/\">Astral Saw</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Starlight_Sickle/\">Starlight Sickle</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Celestial_Hammer/\">Celestial Hammer</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Heavenly_Pollaxe/\">Heavenly Pollaxe</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eclipse_Crossbow/\">Eclipse Crossbow</a> and the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lunar_Staff/\">Lunar Staff</a>. To craft these you need to combine a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moon_Shard/\">Moon Shard</a> with a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod/\">Hardened Moon Rod</a>, which you can buy from the second floor of the shop for 10,250 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">candy</a>.\n</p><p>However at the bottom of The Manor is another Altar that you can use to craft the Hallowing. To Craft you need to combine a piece of Raw <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Catseye/\">Catseye</a>, a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Plastic_Spiders/\">Plastic Spider</a> and a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Broken_Fence/\">Broken Fence</a>, during a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blood_Moon/\">Blood Moon</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Small_candle/\">Small Candle</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Small candle\">Small candle</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>250 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tall_Candle/\">Tall Candle</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Tall candle\">Tall candle</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>300 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Big_Candle/\">Big Candle</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Big candle\">Big candle</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>325 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span title=\"Hallowed Lantern (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGFsbG93ZWRfTGFudGVybj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Hallowed Lantern</span>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hollowed candle\">Hollowed candle</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>320 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span title=\"Hallowed Candlestick (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGFsbG93ZWRfQ2FuZGxlc3Rp